{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106409","id":2520338644,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6WOVDU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106409","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106409.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106409.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106409","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106409/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106409/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106409/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a7cf2069d5acda3b39608c70cbcde55d91463a87","number":106409,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Add abstract methods","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#1631.\r\n* Supersedes #82987.\r\n* Continuation of #67777.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nabstract class Item:\r\n    abstract func get_name() -> String\r\n\r\n    func use() -> void:\r\n        print(\"Character used %s.\" % get_name())\r\n\r\nclass HealingPotion extends Item:\r\n    func get_name() -> String:\r\n        return \"Healing Potion\"\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n    var potion := HealingPotion.new()\r\n    potion.use() # Prints `Character used Healing Potion.`\r\n```\r\n\r\n* An abstract function cannot have a body. An abstract function declaration ends with a newline or a semicolon.\r\n* A class that has at least one unimplemented abstract method (own or inherited) must be declared abstract.\r\n* An abstract method of a base class cannot be called with `super()`.\r\n* An abstract method implemented in a child class can be marked as abstract again in a grandchild class.\r\n* Static functions cannot be abstract because GDScript does not yet have late static binding.\r\n* Inline setters/getters cannot be abstract (but separate functions can).\r\n* Constructors can be abstract (but GDScript does not check signature compatibility for constructors).\r\n* Lambda functions cannot be abstract because there is no point in doing so.\r\n* The warning `UNUSED_PARAMETER` is not produced for abstract functions.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at"